[00:02.98]Music, reality
[00:06.06]Sometimes it's hard to tell the difference
[00:09.62]But we as entertainers
[00:12.33]Have a responsibility to these kids
[00:17.78]Psych!
[00:19.59]If I were to die, murdered in cold blood tomorrow
[00:23.01]Would you feel sorrow, or show love? Or would it matter?
[00:25.33]Could never be the lead-off batter
[00:28.37]If there ain't shit for me to feed off, I'm see-saw battlin'
[00:29.96]But there's way too much at stake for me to be fake
[00:32.70]There's too much on my plate, I done came way
[00:35.63]Too far in this game to turn and walk away
[00:38.48]And not say what I got to say
[00:41.49]What the fuck you take me for, a joke? You smokin' crack?
[00:42.87]'Fore I do that, I'd beg Mariah to take me back
[00:45.44]I'll get up 'fore I get down, run myself in the ground
[00:48.63]'Fore I put some wack shit out
[00:51.14]I'm tryna smack this one out the park: five-thousand mark
[00:52.97]Y'all steady tryna drown a shark; ain't gon' do nothin' but piss me off
[00:55.95]Lid to the can of whip-ass, just twist me off
[00:58.90]See me leap out, pull a piece out
[01:01.98]Fuck shootin', I'm just tryna knock his teeth out
[01:04.74]Fuck with me now, bitch; let's see you freestyle
[01:07.87]Talk is cheap, motherfucker, if you really feelin' froggish, leap
[01:10.41]Yo, Slim, you gon' let him get away with that?
[01:12.58]He tried to play you, you can't let him skate with that
[01:15.19]Man, I hate this crap, this ain't rap
[01:18.12]This is crazy, the way we act when we confuse hip-hop
[01:19.47]With real life when the music stops
[01:22.00]Ain't no gettin' rid of McVay, if so, you would've tried
[01:24.86]The only way I'm leavin' this bitch is suicide
[01:26.94]I have died clinically; arrived back at my enemies'
[01:29.26]Crib with Hennessy, got drunk then I finished he
[01:31.28]I'm every nigga's favorite archenemy
[01:34.47]Physically fitted to be the most dangerous nigga with beef
[01:38.14]I spark willingly, with a Dillinger
[01:39.97]In the dark, diligently, I'm not what you think
[01:43.68]I appear to be fucked up, mentally endangered
[01:45.69]I can't stay away from a razor
[01:48.63]I just want my face in a paper, I wish a nigga had a grenade
[01:51.23]To squeeze tight to awake neighbors for acres
[01:53.19]I'll murder you; I gauge and have me turn into
[01:55.26]A mad man, Son of Sam; bitch, I'm surgical
[01:57.13]I'm allergic to dyin' - you think not?
[02:00.48]You got balls? We can see how large, when the music stops
[02:02.12]I was happy havin' a deal at first
[02:04.77]Thought money would make me happy, but it only made my pain worse
[02:07.50]It hurts when you see your friends turn their back on you, dawg
[02:09.87]And you ain't got nothin' left but your word and your balls
[02:11.83]And you're stressed from the calls of your new friends
[02:14.06]Beggin' with their hands out, checkin' for your record when it's sellin'
[02:17.27]When it ain't, that's the end: no laughs, no friends
[02:20.12]No girls, just the gin you drink 'til your car spin
[02:22.49]You think, "Damn!" when you slam into the wall and you fall
[02:25.24]Out the car and try to crawl with one arm
[02:28.02]I'm 'bout to lose it all in a pool of alcohol
[02:30.37]If my funeral's tomorrow, wonder would they even call? When the music stops
[02:32.43]Let's see how many of your men loyal, when I pull up
[02:35.53]Lookin' for you with a pistol, sippin' a can of Pennzoil
[02:38.35]I'm revved up; who said what? When lead bust
[02:41.93]Your head just explode with red stuff, I'm handcuffed
[02:44.19]Tossed in the paddy-wagon, braggin' about
[02:46.59]How you shouted like a coward, bullets devoured you, showered you niggas
[02:49.09]If I was you niggas, I'd run while given a chance
[02:52.16]Understand, I can enhance the spirit of man
[02:54.37]Death itself, it can't hurt me, just the thought of dyin'
[02:55.74]Alone that really irks me, you ain't worthy
[02:59.24]To speak thoughts of cheap talk, be smart
[03:00.55]And stop tryna walk how Gs walk before we spark
[03:03.62]Hug the floor while we playin' tug-of-war wit' your life
[03:06.37]Fuck a tour and a mic, I'd rather fuck a whore with a knife
[03:09.08]Deliver that shit that coroners like you hype
[03:11.61]Poppin' shit in broad daylight, nigga, you're a goner at night
[03:12.94]When the music stops
[03:16.10]Instigators turn pits in cages
[03:18.67]Let loose and bit the neighbors; wrist to razors
[03:19.87]Y'all don't want war, y'all want talk
[03:22.47]In the dark, my dogs all bark, like, "Woof!"
[03:24.77]Proof, nigga, I'm a wolf
[03:27.84]Get your whole roof caved in, like reindeer hoofs
[03:30.50]Stomp the booth, shake the floor tiles loose
[03:32.43]The more y'all breathe, shit, the more I moves
[03:34.70]It's Hill Street: this is hardcore blues
[03:37.93]Put a gun to rap, check in all our dues (Nigga)
[03:40.64]Or make the news, bet you all y'all move
[03:41.84]When the Uzi pop, you better drop, when the music stop
[03:45.45]Music has changed my life in so many ways
[03:49.32]Brain's confused, been fucked since the 5th grade
[03:51.77]LL told me to rock the bells
[03:53.89]N.W.A said "Fuck the Police," now I'm in jail
[03:55.76]'93 was strictly R&B
[03:59.30]Fucked up haircut, listened to Jodeci
[04:01.08]Michael Jackson - who gon' tell me I ain't Mike?
[04:03.85]Ass cheeks painted white, fuckin' Priscilla tonight
[04:06.49]Flyin' down Sunset, smokin' crack
[04:08.94]Transvestite in the front, Eddie Murphy in the back
[04:12.13]M.O.P. had me grimy and gritty
[04:14.32]Marilyn Manson - I dyed my hair blue, and grew some titties
[04:16.09]Ludacris told me to throw them bows
[04:20.67]Now I'm in the hospital with a broken nose and a fractured elbow
[04:22.44]Voices in my head, I'm goin' in shock
[04:25.77]I'm reachin' for the Glock, but the music stops
